      "message": "fix(3d): an Adaptive fallback to Offset rings raises a warning\n\nAn Adaptive op whose planner gives an area (a 2D pocket, a 3D level) to\nthe Offset rings now carries an advisory Warning::StrategyFallback with\nthe count of such areas. Before, the fallback was only in the notes and\nthe op reported warnings=0. The rings are verified like any path, so the\npost is not held.\n\nRefs #3035\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
